# Deployment boundary. This is a static root deploy with no build step on Vercel,
# so anything not excluded here is uploaded and publicly fetchable.
#
# Before this file existed, generate.mjs, cities.json, blog.json and the contents
# of legal-drafts/ were all served with HTTP 200 on the live domain, including a
# terms draft whose own first line reads "DO NOT PUBLISH AS-IS".
#
# Rule of thumb: if it is an input to `node generate.mjs` rather than an output of
# it, it belongs here. The generated .html, sitemap.xml, llms.txt, robots.txt,
# images/ and guides/ are what the public site actually needs.

# Generator and its data inputs
generate.mjs
cities.json
blog.json
reviews.json
projects.json
routines.json

# Source fragments that get inlined into generated pages
posts/
routines-src/

# Templates. vercel.json already redirects /template-* and marks them noindex,
# but excluding them means they are never uploaded in the first place.
template-home.html
template-city.html
template-packages.html

# Drafts and internal working files. legal-drafts/ is the critical one: it holds
# attorney-review drafts that must never be public.
legal-drafts/
blog-drafts/
_to_delete/

# Repo tooling and docs, not part of the site
README.md
.claude/
.git/
.gitignore

# Build manifest: local build state, not part of the public site
.build-manifest.json
